cfg get: fake
fixed get: Proxy get trap cannot report different value for non-configurable non-writable key
cfg set: true
fixed set: Proxy set trap cannot report success changing non-configurable non-writable key
cfg hidden desc: true
cfg hidden closed desc: Proxy getOwnPropertyDescriptor trap cannot hide key on non-extensible target
cfg define nonconfig: Proxy defineProperty trap cannot report configurable key as non-configurable
cfg delete open: true
side delete closed: Proxy deleteProperty trap cannot report deletion of key on non-extensible target
side has closed: Proxy has trap cannot report false for key on non-extensible target
side keys missing: TypeError: Proxy ownKeys trap result missing key on non-extensible target
side keys exact: length,name,prototype,side
side keys extra: TypeError: Proxy ownKeys trap result included extra key on non-extensible target
fixed keys missing: TypeError: Proxy ownKeys trap result missing non-configurable key
